		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=18128#p18128"><![CDATA[
Hi!<br><br>I am Ignacio Sanchez from <a href="http://www.geardome.com" class="postlink">Geardome</a>.<br><br>We are about to release a game for iPhone and iPod touch called <a href="http://ozone.geardome.com" class="postlink">Ozone</a>, that uses Bullet for its physic simulation.<br><br>The game, mix of an action and a puzzle game, is highly detailed and complex in comparison with the average games on the Store. We have taken care of every aspect of its development, including smooth visuals and a crystal clear sound track. This sound track is one of its big points and can be downloaded freely from the website.<br><br>We are very proud of how bullet has been integrated into the game and the benefit of letting us focus in the gameplay.<br><br>Bullet runs quite good on iPhone and we are planning to keep using it in future games. We want to thank the developers behind bullet for such a great free library!<br><br>Ozone will be out on April 9th on the App Store. Give it a try!<br><br><a href="http://ozone.geardome.com" class="postlink">http://ozone.geardome.com</a><br><br><img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-02.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"> <img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-04.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-05.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"> <img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-07.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-09.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"> <img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-10.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-14.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"> <img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-15.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="http://www.geardome.com/ozone-iphone/ozone-iphone-17.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"